==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|за-|бить}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|заби́ть}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-забить.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|заби́ть|pf|impf=забива́ть}}

# to [[drive in]] (nail), to [[hammer]] in, to [[nail]] up
# to [[score]] (a goal)
# to [[beat up]]
# to [[slaughter]]
# to [[block up]], to [[stop up]], to [[cram]], to [[obstruct]]
# {{lb|ru|colloquial}} to [[outdo]], to [[surpass]]
# {{lb|ru|slang}} to [[ignore]], to [[neglect]], to [[blow off]] {{non-gloss|something the actor is supposed to do}}
#: {{uxi|ru|Он '''забил''' на работу и уехал на дачу|He '''blew off''' work and left to the dacha}}
# {{lb|ru|slang}} to stop doing something {{non-gloss|especially because of one's [[couldn't care less]] attitude}}
# {{lb|ru|slang}} to [[give up]] on one's (previous) intention
# {{lb|ru|slang}} to [[reserve]], to earmark

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|pf|11b+p|заби́ть}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|ru|заби́ть болт}}

